**Film:** Phext Edit training film, Round 7 ("T7"). Built under
`REVISION-BRIEF-T7.md` (Will's go-ahead 2026-11-11 18:22 CST:
D1 = Option B, extend the length; all 25 rules; new script and new
narration stem; §08 crop fix mandatory). Reference coordinate
28.6.11/7.6.10/6.5.8.
**Master:** `rough-cut-t7.mp4` — on aletheia-core at
`~/phext-walkthrough-capture/r7/rough-cut-r7.mp4` and on this VM at
`~/workspace/phext-walkthrough/production/rough-cut-t7.mp4`
(byte-identical, SHA-256 verified both sides).
**Served:** https://100.88.154.1:8448/rough-cut-t7.mp4 (tailnet,
self-signed R4 cert as R4–R6; transient user unit `serve-t7-tls`;
HEAD verified 200 with the right length, and a byte-range slice at
offset 1,000,000 hash-matched to the master: c3af5384… — both checks
run from the node against the tailnet address; a fetch from this VM
through the egress proxy returned an empty reply, the same proxy
quirk recorded for R4/R5/R6, so the node-side verification is the
one on record. The unit is transient and won't survive a node
reboot, same as R4–R6.)
