| Picture-only tail | none | **none — last speech ends 447.05 s; what follows is §08's designed 22.38 s CTA hold** |
| Frames / rate | constant 60 fps | **28,167 frames @ 60/1 constant (nominal 28,166; +1 across the 9 xfade joins, inside the established ±2 tolerance)** |
| Length (D1) | ~6:47+ (407 s) | **469.4 s (7:49.4)** — longer than the brief's pre-slot-table estimate; every per-unit pacing rule below is met, so the length is the sum of compliant parts, not drift |
| Loudness | −14 ±0.5 LUFS, TP ≤ −1.5 | **−14.2 LUFS integrated, −1.5 dBFS peak** (ebur128 on the muxed file; mastered WAV measured −14.22 LUFS / −1.96 dBTP pre-mux) |
| Faststart | moov before mdat | **yes — moov @ byte 32, mdat @ 746,136** |

Master: 129,978,645 bytes, SHA-256
